=== A2a: lock that NEVER publishes (owner process alive, window never closes) ===
elapsed_ms=3557
rc=3 reclaimed=false inc= owner_state=UNKNOWN owner_detail=the lock carries no owner record and none appeared while it was waited on publish_waits=120 
=== A2b: genuinely unjudgeable lock (malformed record) must cost ZERO wait ===
record=not json                         elapsed_ms=116 rc=3 reclaimed=false inc= owner_state=UNKNOWN owner_detail=the lock owner record could not be parsed publish_waits=0 
record={}                               elapsed_ms=121 rc=3 reclaimed=false inc= owner_state=UNKNOWN owner_detail=the lock owner record is written in a schema this version does not know publish_waits=0 
record={"lock_schema_version":"9.9"}    elapsed_ms=125 rc=3 reclaimed=false inc= owner_state=UNKNOWN owner_detail=the lock owner record is written in a schema this version does not know publish_waits=0 
=== A2c: foreign / boot-mismatch locks must cost ZERO wait ===
foreign elapsed_ms=254 rc=3 reclaimed=false inc= owner_state=FOREIGN owner_detail=the lock was taken on another host publish_waits=0 
lock_still_there=yes
=== A2d: ownerless directory with NO owner process at all (pure orphan dir) ===
orphan elapsed_ms=3605 rc=3 reclaimed=false inc= owner_state=UNKNOWN owner_detail=the lock carries no owner record and none appeared while it was waited on publish_waits=120 
lock_still_there=yes
